        "name": "伊法",
        "desc": "来自花羽会的兽医，由衷热爱着与人、动物，以及其他生灵为伴的生活。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/04/30/ce693d1e36aef5936b2d2db006605fc4_9036718103340803450.png",
